- op: discuss  # 53c7
  at: '2026-11-10T03:12:31Z'  # 53c7
  by: agent  # 53c7
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 53c7
  clock: 3  # 53c7
  nonce: 53c7  # 53c7
  message: "Fixed in PR #2111: pinned GITLEAKS_VERSION=8.30.0; the archive must match GITLEAKS_ARCHIVE_SHA256 (copied from gitleaks_8.30.0_checksums.txt) before any write. Live evidence: a real install into a scratch HOME installs a binary with SHA-256 8b6fd684...f088, identical to the official linux_x64 archive's binary and to the existing ~/.local/bin/gitleaks; the same download against a wrong expected hash prints 'has SHA-256 79a3ab57..., but gitleaks 8.30.0 published 0000...; not installing it', returns False, and ~/.local/bin is never created."  # 53c7
